      "text": "he gave them power against unclean spirits, Matt. 10:1. coming … with power and great glory, Matt. 24:30 (JS—M 1:36). All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth, Matt. 28:18. Son of man hath power … to forgive sins, Mark 2:10 (Luke 5:24). All things were made by him, John 1:3. gave he power to become the sons of God, John 1:12. given him power over all flesh, John 17:2. God hath made that same Jesus … both Lord and Christ, Acts 2:36. declared to be the Son of God with power, Rom. 1:4. gospel of Christ … the power of God unto salvation, Rom. 1:16. his eternal power and Godhead, Rom. 1:20. he shall have put down all … authority and power, 1 Cor. 15:24. put all things under his feet, Eph. 1:22. Strengthened … according to his glorious power, Col. 1:11. power, be unto him that sitteth upon the throne, Rev. 5:13. Lord of lords, and King of kings, Rev. 17:14. Lord God omnipotent reigneth, Rev. 19:6.",
